{"name":"Bloody Periphylla","hex":"#aa1144","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bloody","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Covered in blood.","Characterised by bloodshed."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Used to express anger, annoyance, or shock, or for emphasis."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bloody"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bloody","blocks":[{"text":"Bloody, as an adjective or adverb, is an expletive attributive commonly used in British, Irish, Australian and New Zealand English. It is also used in Canada, India, Hawaii, Kenya, Malaysia, New Caledonia, Singapore, South Africa, Zimbabwe and a number of other Commonwealth nations. It has been used as an intensive since at least the 1670s."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bloody","wikidata":"Q4928046"},{"title":"Helmet jellyfish","blocks":[{"text":"The helmet jellyfish, sometimes called the merchant-cap, is a luminescent, red-colored jellyfish of the deep sea, belonging to the order Coronatae of the phylum Cnidaria. It is the only species in the monotypic genus Periphylla and a rare example of a scyphozoan with a polyp-less life cycle, occurring exclusively as a medusa.\n\nPeriphylla is intensely photophobic, and thus only seldom leaves the bathypelagic zone."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/Periphylla_periphylla00.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helmet_jellyfish","wikidata":"Q445245"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Helmet_jellyfish_feeding_on_gonatid_squid.jpg/330px-Helmet_jellyfish_feeding_on_gonatid_squid.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Helmet_jellyfish_feeding_on_gonatid_squid.jpg/330px-Helmet_jellyfish_feeding_on_gonatid_squid.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Helmet jellyfish feeding on an armhook squid underwater","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHelmet_jellyfish_feeding_on_gonatid_squid.jpg"}],"sounds":{"bloody":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/En-us-bloody.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/En-us-bloody.ogg/En-us-bloody.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/En-uk-bloody.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/En-uk-bloody.ogg/En-uk-bloody.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/EN-AU_ck1_bloody.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f0/EN-AU_ck1_bloody.ogg/EN-AU_ck1_bloody.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Exterior spherical lantern on a matte red painted brick facade in Seoul","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Exterior_spherical_lantern_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_in_Seoul.jpg/500px-Exterior_spherical_lantern_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_in_Seoul.jpg","ratio":0.7500456121145777,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Exterior_spherical_lantern_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_in_Seoul.jpg","share":0.235},{"title":"Two blue water meters on a matte red painted brick facade with pipes in Seoul","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Two_blue_water_meters_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_with_pipes_in_Seoul.jpg/500px-Two_blue_water_meters_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_with_pipes_in_Seoul.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"h